SUMMARY:90 Minutes of Innovation: The Future of Medicine
LOCATION:The Pub
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Chat\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 1 spot left\
 nStatus: You are on Waitlist\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/
 events/205637\n\n12:00PM  - 1:30PM Program\nWhat will it take to accelera
 te the next generation of medical breakthroughs—and rethink how discover
 ies make their way from the lab to the people who need them? In the latest
  edition of 90 Minutes of Innovation\, John Werner\, venture capitalist\, 
 MIT lecturer\, and Forbes AI columnist\, and Alexander Wissner-Gross\, res
 earch scientist and entrepreneur\, sit down with Peter Kolchinsky\, PhD\, 
 Founder and Managing Partner of RA Capital Management and author of The Gr
 eat American Drug Deal\, for a conversation at the intersection of science
 \, technology\, investment\, and healthcare.\n\nWith a PhD in Virology fro
 m Harvard University\, Kolchinsky has spent decades investing in companies
  developing drugs\, medical devices\, diagnostics\, and research tools\, w
 hile advocating for approaches that make medicines more affordable without
  sacrificing the innovation behind tomorrow’s breakthroughs. Through his
  work with RA Capital and No Patient Left Behind\, he has become a leading
  voice in conversations surrounding biotechnology\, drug development\, aff
 ordability\, and the incentives that shape the future of medicine.\n\nToge
 ther\, Werner\, Wissner-Gross\, and Kolchinsky will explore how artificial
  intelligence and emerging technologies could accelerate scientific discov
 ery\, reshape the development of new treatments\, and transform the broade
 r healthcare landscape. From getting promising discoveries to patients fas
 ter to balancing affordability with continued investment in innovation\, e
 xpect a wide-ranging conversation about what’s possible when science\, t
 echnology\, and new ways of thinking converge.\n\n*This event is complimen
 tary and reserved for members only. Complimentary light bites and refreshm
 ents will be served. We kindly ask that all cancellations be made at least
  24 hours prior to the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/205637
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Chat
END:VEVENT
